          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "f2d5fb89-c95f-40c9-bfee-75f0169781de",
                "quote": "如果可以，我會自己跳到軌道上，不要拉也不要害別人。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 25
